+# Payment Audit Log — Event Traceability Matrix
+
+Source of truth: design §10.3 (`docs/payment-system/design.md`). All `payment_audit_log` rows are INSERT-only, emitted inside the same PL/pgSQL function transaction as the state change (SECURITY DEFINER RPCs).
+
+## Design §10.3 catalog (17 required lifecycle events)
+
+| `event_type` | Produced in | Edge Function / caller | Same TX | Actor | Required metadata |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `CHARGE_SCHEDULED` | `accept_proposal_rpc()` | `accept-proposal` | Yes | `client` | `gateway_slug`, `installment_number`, `base_amount` |
+| `PAYMENT_TERMS_ACCEPTED` | `accept_proposal_rpc()` | `accept-proposal` | Yes | `client` | `gateway_slug`, `accepted_at` |
+| `CHARGE_ATTEMPT_STARTED` | `cron_charge_dequeue_rpc()` | `schedule-netcred-charges` | Yes | `cron` | `automatic_attempt_count` |
+| `CHARGE_PAID` | `cron_charge_commit_result_rpc()`, `webhook_transaction_capture_rpc()` | `schedule-netcred-charges`, `netcred-webhook` | Yes | `cron` / `webhook` | `charge_amount`, gateway ids |
+| `CHARGE_FAILED` | `cron_charge_commit_result_rpc()`, `manual_charge_commit_rpc()` | cron / `manual-charge-payment` | Yes | `cron` / `client` | `failure_code`, attempt metadata |
+| `CHARGE_FAILED_PERMANENT` | commit RPCs, `webhook_transaction_rejected_rpc()` | cron / manual / webhook | Yes | `cron` / `client` / `webhook` | `failure_code`, `webhook_event_id` |
+| `CHARGE_IN_ANALYSIS` | commit RPCs (design: `IN_ANALYSIS_STARTED`) | cron / manual | Yes | `cron` / `client` | gateway response summary |
+| `MANUAL_PAYMENT_INITIATED` | `manual_charge_acquire_lease_rpc()` | `manual-charge-payment` | Yes | `client` | lease metadata |
+| `REFUND_SUBMITTED` | `process_refund_submit_rpc()` | `process-refund` | Yes | `client` / `provider` | `refund_amount`, `gateway_transaction_id` |
+| `REFUND_FAILED` | `process_refund_record_failed_rpc()` | `process-refund` | Yes | `client` / `provider` | error message |
+| `AUTO_CANCELLED` | `auto_cancel_services_rpc()` | `auto-cancel-unpaid-services` | Yes | `system` | cancellation reason |
+| `ORPHAN_RECOVERED` | `recover_orphaned_payment_schedules()` | `recover-payment-leases` | Yes | `system` | `target_state`, attempt count |
+| `WEBHOOK_PROCESSED` | — | — | — | — | **Gap:** webhook state transitions log outcome-specific events (`CHARGE_PAID`, etc.); generic `WEBHOOK_PROCESSED` audit row not yet inserted |
+| `PROVIDER_ACTIVATED` | `activate_provider_account_rpc()` | `detect-netcred-onboarding` | Yes | `system` | `netcred_company_id` |
+| `SERVICE_EXECUTED` | `mark_service_executed_rpc()` | provider UI / RPC | Yes | `provider` | `executed_at` |
+| `SERVICE_COMPLETED` | — | — | — | — | **Gap:** client confirmation RPC not implemented; `SERVICE_AUTO_COMPLETED` covers system path only |
+| `CHARGE_RESCHEDULED` | `reschedule_charge_date_rpc()` | reschedule subsystem | Yes | `system` | `old_charge_scheduled_at`, `new_charge_scheduled_at` |
+| `PAYMENT_METHOD_UPDATED` | `update_payment_method_rpc()` | `update-payment-method` | Yes | `client` | old/new token and brand |
+
+## Additional implemented events (beyond §10.3 sample)
+
+| `event_type` | Produced in | Actor |
+|---|---|---|
+| `KYC_SUBMITTED` | `submit_provider_kyc_rpc()` | `provider` |
+| `PRE_CHARGE_CANCELLED` | `process_refund_pre_charge_cancel_rpc()` | `client` / `provider` |
+| `REFUND_CONFIRMED` | `webhook_transaction_refund_rpc()` | `webhook` |
+| `CHARGE_VOIDED` | `webhook_charge_void_rpc()` | `webhook` |
+| `TRANSACTION_DISPUTED` | `webhook_transaction_dispute_rpc()` | `webhook` |
+| `PAYMENT_PROFILE_DELETED` | `webhook_payment_profile_deleted_rpc()` | `webhook` |
+| `SERVICE_AUTO_COMPLETED` | `auto_complete_executed_services_rpc()` | `system` |
+| `RECONCILIATION_*` | `reconcile_netcred_payment_rpc()` | `system` |
+
+## Verification
+
+- **Catalog sync:** `supabase/functions/_shared/payment/__tests__/audit_log_catalog_test.ts` asserts each implemented design event appears in a `payment_audit_log` INSERT migration.
+- **Same-TX guard:** `supabase/tests/payment/audit_log_event_catalog_test.sql` (pgTAP) checks co-located INSERT + state UPDATE in RPC function bodies.
+- **Known gaps:** `WEBHOOK_PROCESSED`, `SERVICE_COMPLETED` — tracked for a follow-up migration/RPC.
+
+## Lifecycle reconstruction query
+
+```sql
+select
+  created_at,
+  event_type,
+  actor,
+  actor_id,
+  from_state,
+  to_state,
+  metadata
+from public.payment_audit_log
+where service_id = :service_id
+order by created_at asc, id asc;
+```
