+# Payment Edge Function Log Events
+
+Structured JSON logs emitted by payment Edge Functions. All entries include `level`, `scope`, `event`, and `timestamp`. When `service_id` is known it is duplicated as `correlation_id` for log drain correlation.
+
+## Common fields
+
+| Field | When present | Description |
+|---|---|---|
+| `service_id` | Charge and service-scoped flows | Contracted service UUID (primary correlation key) |
+| `correlation_id` | Always when `service_id` or webhook `gateway_event_id` is set | Same as `service_id`, or webhook event id |
+| `schedule_id` | Schedule-scoped flows | `payment_schedules.id` |
+| `gateway_slug` | Gateway interactions | e.g. `netcred` |
+| `error_code` | Failures | Canonical or provider failure code |
+
+## Mandatory events
+
+### `charge_attempt_started`
+
+Cron or manual charge path begins gateway interaction.
+
+| Field | Required |
+|---|---|
+| `service_id` | yes |
+| `schedule_id` | yes |
+| `gateway_slug` | yes |
+| `attempt_number` | yes |
+| `charge_amount` | when known |
+| `initiator` | `cron` or `manual` |
+
+### `charge_attempt_completed`
+
+Charge attempt finished (any terminal schedule outcome).
+
+| Field | Required |
+|---|---|
+| `service_id` | yes |
+| `schedule_id` | yes |
+| `gateway_slug` | yes |
+| `outcome` | yes (`PAID`, `FAILED`, `FAILED_PERMANENT`, `IN_ANALYSIS`) |
+| `gateway_latency_ms` | when gateway called |
+| `charge_amount` | when known |
+| `attempt_number` | yes |
+| `reconciled` | when idempotent replay |
+
+### `charge_attempt_failed`
+
+Unhandled error before or during charge (infrastructure, missing token, etc.).
+
+| Field | Required |
+|---|---|
+| `service_id` | when known |
+| `schedule_id` | yes |
+| `gateway_slug` | when known |
+| `error_code` | when classified |
+| `error` | human-readable message |
+
+### `webhook_received`
+
+Inbound webhook persisted (before signature validation).
+
+| Field | Required |
+|---|---|
+| `event_type` | yes |
+| `gateway_event_id` | yes |
+| `gateway_slug` | yes |
+
+### `webhook_processed`
+
+Webhook handler finished (sync path or duplicate/unknown short-circuit).
+
+| Field | Required |
+|---|---|
+| `event_type` | yes |
+| `gateway_event_id` | when known |
+| `processing_duration_ms` | yes |
+| `outcome` | yes (`processed`, `duplicate`, `queued`, `unknown_event_type`, `failed`) |
+| `gateway_slug` | yes |
+
+### `orphan_recovered`
+
+Janitor recovered a schedule stuck in `PROCESSING` lease.
+
+| Field | Required |
+|---|---|
+| `target_state` | `SCHEDULED` or `FAILED` |
+| `gateway_slug` | yes |
+| `recovery_index` | per-recovery row in batch |
