+# Payment System — Migration Safety Checklist
+
+**Task:** 81  
+**Date:** 2026-06-25  
+**Scope:** Payment migrations Phase 1–2 (Tasks 1–16) + operational index/cron review
+
+## Summary
+
+| Check | Result | Notes |
+|-------|--------|-------|
+| Additive DDL (no DROP/RENAME/ALTER TYPE in payment Phase 1–2) | **PASS** | Payment `20260624*` + `202607052071–079` migrations are additive |
