+## Non-blocking index strategy
+
+Supabase migrations run inside a transaction; **`CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY` cannot run in migrations**. Local/dev migrations use standard `CREATE INDEX` (acceptable on empty or reset DBs).
+
+**Production:** apply `supabase/scripts/growth/payment_indexes_concurrently.sql` during a maintenance window **after** initial deploy. Each statement is idempotent (`IF NOT EXISTS` via DO block or manual check).
