+# Payment System — Phased Rollout Plan
+
+**Task:** 80  
+**Date:** 2026-06-24  
+**Feature flag:** `payment_system_v1` (via `platform_constants`)
+
+## Controls
+
+| Constant | Default | Purpose |
+|----------|---------|---------|
+| `payment_system_rollout_percentage` | `0` | 0–100 gate on `accept-proposal` |
+| `charge_cron_dry_run` | `true` | Cron logs dequeue payloads without NetCred calls |
+
+**Gate logic (`accept-proposal`):** when `random() * 100 > rollout_percentage`, return HTTP 403 `{ error: "feature_not_available" }`.
+
+**Shadow mode (`schedule-netcred-charges`):** when `charge_cron_dry_run = true`, cron dequeues eligible schedules, logs payload, reverts lease to `SCHEDULED` (no gateway, no commit).
+
+## Phases
+
+### Phase 0 — Pre-rollout (current)
+
+- `payment_system_rollout_percentage = 0` → all clients blocked at accept.
+- `charge_cron_dry_run = true` → shadow cron validates dequeue + logging.
+- All payment pg_cron jobs registered with `active = false` (see `20260705208700_register_payment_pg_cron_jobs.sql`).
+
+### Phase 1 — Internal team (5%)
+
+```sql
+update platform_constants
+set value = '5'::jsonb
+where key = 'payment_system_rollout_percentage';
+```
+
+- Enable internal allowlist monitoring (Sentry tag `payment_rollout`).
+- Keep `charge_cron_dry_run = true`.
+- Cron jobs remain inactive.
+
+### Phase 2 — Pilot cohort (20%)
+
+```sql
+update platform_constants
+set value = '20'::jsonb
+where key = 'payment_system_rollout_percentage';
+
+update platform_constants
+set value = 'false'::jsonb
+where key = 'charge_cron_dry_run';
+```
+
+- Activate charge cron jobs:
+
+```sql
+update cron.job
+set active = true
+where jobname in (
+  'schedule-netcred-charges',
+  'auto-cancel-unpaid-services',
+  'notify-upcoming-charges',
+  'recover-payment-leases',
+  'reconcile-netcred-payments',
+  'process-webhook-retry'
+);
+```
+
+- Monitor: charge success rate, FAILED_PERMANENT count, webhook lag.
+
+### Phase 3 — Full rollout (100%)
+
+**Prerequisite:** 72h shadow/dry-run validation with zero unexpected dequeue errors.
+
+```sql
+update platform_constants
+set value = '100'::jsonb
+where key = 'payment_system_rollout_percentage';
+```
+
+- Enable remaining crons (`detect-netcred-onboarding`, `auto-complete-executed-services`).
+- Remove dry-run after 72h live pilot if not already disabled.
+
+## Rollback
+
+1. Set `payment_system_rollout_percentage = 0`.
+2. Set `charge_cron_dry_run = true`.
+3. `update cron.job set active = false where jobname like '%netcred%' or jobname like '%payment%';`
+4. In-flight schedules continue through existing state machine; no new accepts.
+
+## Verification checklist
+
+- [ ] `accept-proposal` returns 403 when rollout = 0
+- [ ] Shadow cron summary includes `dry_run` count, zero `paid`
+- [ ] Phase 2 cron activation confirmed in `cron.job`
+- [ ] 72h shadow log review signed off before Phase 3
+
+## Related
+
+- Migration: `20260705221601_payment_rollout_platform_constants.sql`
+- EF gates: `accept-proposal/checkPaymentFeatureFlag.ts`, `schedule-netcred-charges/dryRunProcessSchedule.ts`
