+# Payment System — Production Smoke Test Runbook
+
+**Task:** 82  
+**Date:** 2026-06-25  
+**GO/NO-GO:** All 10 smoke tests must **PASS** before raising `payment_system_rollout_percentage` above 0.
+
+## Prerequisites
+
+| Variable | Required for |
+|----------|----------------|
+| `SUPABASE_URL` | All automated checks |
+| `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` | DB + EF invocations |
+| `NETCRED_WEBHOOK_SECRET` | Test 8 (webhook HMAC) |
+| `PAYMENT_SMOKE_FUNCTIONS_URL` | Optional override (defaults to `{SUPABASE_URL}/functions/v1`) |
+
+## Automated runner
+
+```bash
+source ~/.nvm/nvm.sh && nvm use 24.13
+export SUPABASE_URL="https://<project>.supabase.co"
+export SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY="<service_role_jwt>"
+export NETCRED_WEBHOOK_SECRET="<vault_secret>"
+
+deno run -A --config supabase/functions/deno.json supabase/scripts/payment-smoke-test.ts
+```
+
+Exit code **0** = GO; **1** = NO-GO.
+
+Local DB (pgTAP): `supabase test db supabase/tests/payment/production_smoke_test.sql`
+
+---
+
+## Smoke tests
+
+| # | Test | Automated | Pass criteria |
+|---|------|-----------|---------------|
+| 1 | pg_cron jobs registered | Yes | All 8 payment job names exist in `cron.job` |
+| 2 | platform_constants keys | Yes | All 18 `PAYMENT_PLATFORM_CONSTANT_KEYS` present |
+| 3 | NetCred provider seed | Yes | Row `payment_providers.slug = 'netcred'` |
+| 4 | calculate-installment-options | Partial | HTTP 200 + `installment_options` array (needs test proposal env) |
+| 5 | tokenize-payment-card (sandbox) | Manual | Token row created; `state = ACTIVE` |
+| 6 | accept-proposal (dry-run) | Manual | Schedule row created; rollout still 0 or dry-run |
+| 7 | schedule-netcred-charges dry-run | Yes | HTTP 200; summary includes `dry_run >= 0`; no gateway errors |
+| 8 | netcred-webhook HMAC | Yes | HTTP 200; row in `payment_webhook_events` |
+| 9 | recover_orphaned_payment_schedules | Yes | RPC returns `recovered_count = 0` on fresh system |
+| 10 | Sentry alert rule | Manual | Test event visible; `WEBHOOK_DEAD_LETTER` rule armed |
+
+### Test 1 — pg_cron jobs
+
+Expected job names:
+
+- `schedule-netcred-charges`
+- `auto-cancel-unpaid-services`
+- `notify-upcoming-charges`
+- `recover-payment-leases`
+- `reconcile-netcred-payments`
+- `process-webhook-retry`
+- `detect-netcred-onboarding`
+- `auto-complete-executed-services`
+
+Jobs may be `active = false` until Phase 2 rollout — registration alone satisfies smoke test.
+
+### Test 5 — Tokenize (manual)
+
+Use NetCred sandbox test card in staging. Verify no PAN in logs (PCI audit).
+
+### Test 6 — Accept proposal (manual)
+
+Requires credentialed provider + active token + valid HMAC fixtures. With `charge_cron_dry_run = true`, no live charge occurs.
+
+### Test 10 — Sentry (manual)
+
+1. Trigger synthetic error: `captureCriticalAlertSync('PAYMENT_SMOKE_TEST', {})` from staging EF.
+2. Confirm event in Sentry within 5 minutes.
+3. Verify alert rule for `WEBHOOK_DEAD_LETTER` / `CHARGE_FAILED_PERMANENT` is enabled.
+
+---
+
+## GO/NO-GO decision
+
+| Outcome | Action |
+|---------|--------|
+| **GO** (10/10 pass) | Proceed to Phase 1 rollout (`rollout_percentage = 5`) per [rollout-plan.md](./rollout-plan.md) |
+| **NO-GO** | Block feature flag; file incident; re-run after fix |
+
+## Related
+
+- [rollout-plan.md](./rollout-plan.md)
+- [migration-safety-checklist.md](./migration-safety-checklist.md)
+- Script: `supabase/scripts/payment-smoke-test.ts`
